# cmd.exe looks for a batch label in 512-byte blocks and only trusts CRLF
# line ends; in an LF file `goto`/`call` can miss a label that is there.
# The index keeps LF; checkouts, and so the HACS ZIP built from the release
# checkout, get CRLF. Pinned by tests/test_login_launcher_lang.py.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
